- Every algorithm writes inside `/home/ubuntu/data/exp/proj2410/quant_model/Llama2-7B/<algo>/w2g128`, following the naming convention already used by EfficientQAT (`quant_model/Llama2-7B/EfficientQAT/w2g128`).
